`, `p##r##e`) which could never match during greedy scan; the fix normalizes each merged piece using the left symbol\'s continuation status.'}) (input_keys={'filename', 'steps'}): [Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B] litellm.ServiceUnavailableError: ServiceUnavailableError: OpenAIException - Loading model
